OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785158323
OL,3,CWitnesses identify new suspect in
OL,4,Cmurder of mother and daughter 30 years
OL,5,Cago
OL,7,FTwo witnesses have come forward to
OL,8,Fidentify a new suspect for the murder
OL,9,Fof Lin Russell and her six-year-old
OL,10,Fdaughter Megan in Kent 30 years ago.
OL,12,FMichael Stone has been in prison for
OL,13,F29 years, after being found guilty of
OL,14,Fattacking Dr Russell and her two
OL,15,Fdaughters with a hammer as they walked
OL,16,Fhome from a school swimming gala near
OL,17,FCanterbury on July 9, 1996.
OL,19,FThey had moved to the area months
OL,20,Fearlier from the Nantlle valley in
OL,21,FGwynedd.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/7
