FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785158323
OL,3,CWitnesses identify new suspect in
OL,4,Cmurder of mother and daughter 30 years
OL,5,Cago
OL,7,FStone, who was convicted of two counts
OL,8,Fof murder in 1998, and the attempted
OL,9,Fmurder of Dr Russell's nine-year-old
OL,10,Fdaughter Josie, has continually
OL,11,Fpleaded his innocence.
OL,13,FFamily members have given witness
OL,14,Fstatements to the Criminal Cases
OL,15,FReview Commission (CCRC) naming their
OL,16,Frelative Raymond Buck as the killer,
OL,17,Fthe Sunday Times reported.
OL,19,FOne of the new witnesses, Ross
OL,20,FShields, 39, was a child at the time
OL,21,Fof the murders.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785158323
OL,3,CWitnesses identify new suspect in
OL,4,Cmurder of mother and daughter 30 years
OL,5,Cago
OL,7,FHe told the newspaper that he
OL,8,Foverheard Buck confess to a family
OL,9,Fmember on the day of the attacks:
OL,10,F"I've done something unforgivable.
OL,11,FI've killed three people."
OL,13,FAccording to the report, Buck was a
OL,14,Fcarpenter, had a history of violence
OL,15,Fand killed himself aged 46 in 2000.
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,20,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
OL,26,@rD@AOUsD@ZO]
