CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785158323
OL,3,CWitnesses identify new suspect in
OL,4,Cmurder of mother and daughter 30 years
OL,5,Cago
OL,7,FStone's solicitor said that the
OL,8,Fmiscarriages of justice watchdog was
OL,9,Fnow undertaking reviews on the new
OL,10,Fevidence, and gathering fresh DNA
OL,11,Fevidence.
OL,13,FKaren Todner said: "I'm much more
OL,14,Fpositive than he has been for the last
OL,15,F29 years.
OL,17,F"We're hoping that things are finally,
OL,18,Ffinally moving in the right direction.
OL,26,@uD@TOUyD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
