OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785158323
OL,3,CWitnesses identify new suspect in
OL,4,Cmurder of mother and daughter 30 years
OL,5,Cago
OL,7,F"The CCRC are undertaking further DNA
OL,8,Fanalysis. Because obviously the
OL,9,Fscience behind DNA has dramatically
OL,10,Fimproved since his case, and since the
OL,11,Flast DNA analysis.
OL,13,F"So they're doing that. And when
OL,14,Fthey've done that, then we're hoping
OL,15,Fthat they will test that against
OL,16,Fvarious people, Raymond Buck being one
OL,17,Fof them."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUyD@IO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/7
