PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785158323
OL,3,CWitnesses identify new suspect in
OL,4,Cmurder of mother and daughter 30 years
OL,5,Cago
OL,7,FMs Todner explained that while the
OL,8,Foral witness evidence was important,
OL,9,F"conclusive evidence" would be a DNA
OL,10,Fresult.
OL,12,FStone, and a member of Buck's family,
OL,13,Fare among those to submit to this new
OL,14,Fround of DNA analysis.
OL,16,FShe said: "If DNA comes back as
OL,17,Fpositive for anyone other than
OL,18,FMichael, then obviously we'll be
OL,19,Fasking the CCRC to send it back to the
OL,20,FCourt of Appeal.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@UO]xD@KOU
